{"id":"heroemail","code":"<style>.hem{width:340px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:18px 14px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:14px}\n.hem h1{margin:0;font:600 21px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:-.02em;max-width:290px}\n.hem h1 b{color:var(--ink,#fff);font-weight:700}.hem h1 span{color:#6B7482}\n.hem .form{display:flex;gap:8px;width:100%;max-width:290px}\n.hem input{flex:1;height:38px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);background:var(--card,#171B22);color:var(--ink,#fff);padding:0 16px;font:500 12px Inter,sans-serif;outline:none}\n.hem input::placeholder{color:#6B7482}.hem input:focus{border-color:var(--accent,#3366FF)}\n.hem button{background:var(--accent,#3366FF);color:#fff;border:0;font:700 12px Inter,sans-serif;padding:0 18px;border-radius:99px;cursor:pointer}\n.hem .img{width:300px;height:110px;margin-top:2px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#20252E,#0E1219);position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.hem .img::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:14px;border-radius:8px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(#2A2F38 0 7px,transparent 7px 20px)}</style>\n<div class=\"hem\"><h1><b>GOOD WORK. Design Studio:</b> <span>build a site that converts.</span></h1><form class=\"form\" onsubmit=\"return false\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\"><button>Subscribe</button></form><div class=\"img\"></div></div>"}